        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{100} 4n.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we take the factor [MATH: 4] outside the summation:\n[MATH: \\sum_{n=1}^{100} 4n = 4\\sum_{n=1}^{100} n]\n\nNow, using the formula\n[MATH: \u2211_(n = 1)^(N)n|= (1)/(2)N(N + 1)]\nwith [MATH: N=100,] we get\n\n[MATH: 4\u2211_(n = 1)^(100)n|= 4((1)/(2) \u22c5 100 \u22c5 101); = 4 \u22c5 5050; = 20200.]"
      },
