            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2S|= (N + 1) + (2 + N \u2212 1) + \u22ef + (N \u2212 1 + 2) + (N + 1); = (N + 1) + (N + 1) + \u22ef + (N + 1) + (N + 1)_(\u23df)_(Ntimes); = N(N + 1)]",
